{"ref":"BDB, עָלֶ֫מֶת","hw":"עָלֶ֫מֶת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָלֶ֫מֶת</span></big> <strong>1.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.m.</strong> a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.36\">1 Ch 8:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.42\">9:42</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָלָ֑מֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.8\">7:8</a>; 𝔊 Σαλαμαιθ, Γαλεμαθ, Αλαμωθ, etc.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">עַלְמוֹן</span> q.v.) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.45\">1 Ch 6:45</a> Baer Ginsb (van d. H. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַלֶּמֶת</span>).","next":"BDB, יַעְלָם²","prev":"BDB, עֲלָמוֹת"}